                                                "sense_id": "f514c14f-2f74-3ac8-af8f-2c360af29411",
                                                "text": "Her name was Michaela, but the men called her filthy things in dulcet, ingratiating voices, and she giggled with childish joy because she understood no English and thought they were flattering her and making harmless jokes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ff17656-7d62-4c20-9b96-71229a1f1dea",
                                                "sense_id": "f514c14f-2f74-3ac8-af8f-2c360af29411",
                                                "text": "Matthew \"MattKC\" Wong (actor) (2024), 6s from the start, in I ported THOUSANDS of apps to Windows 95: “Ah, yes, the dulcet tones of Windows 95.”"
                                            }
